le=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Second floor <a href=\"#/wiki/Underground%20Glooth%20Factory\">Glooth Underground Factory</a>, east side during a <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond%20Factory%20Raids\">minotaur raid</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFights in close combat like a stronger <a href=\"#/wiki/Moohtant\">Moohtant</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThis creature cannot be killed in this form, however, it can be weakened into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Depowered%20Minotaur\">Depowered Minotaur</a>. To do so, lure the Glooth Powered Minotaur to one of the many Glooth Extractors around the cave. It will become a Depowered Minotaur as soon as it steps on it, and the weak version can be easily killed. \n</p><p>Note that if there are <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Totem\">Minotaur Totems</a> around, you should deal with them first since they heal all creatures around it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 2 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><i